+   pulsing brass glow around the exact card that's the answer, rather
+   than the onboarding tour's full-screen dim-and-spotlight treatment,
+   which would be far too heavy for something that can fire routinely
+   during normal play rather than once at first run. Cleared
+   automatically a few seconds after landing (the destination panel's own
+   highlightId timeout) or the moment the player opens/interacts with the
+   card, whichever comes first.
+   Deliberately generic (`.card.requirement-highlight`, not scoped to
+   `.guild-facility-card`) -- patch 0180 reused this same glow on
